# aiadra-solver (SK-C1 foundation, arc 20260717-2 Gate F1): the replaceable
# LGPL solver artifact home. Git conveys SOURCE + evidence (extraction,
# patches, binding, shims, vendored eigen/pybind11, manifests, digests,
# licenses); the built DLL/PYD stay OUT of git until the binary-distribution
# legal gate is explicitly cleared (ADR/0034 + ADR/0044-A1, Codex16 B1).
# Boost is acquired by the locked src/fetch_boost.py, never committed.
!aiadra-solver/dist/
aiadra-solver/dist/*.dll
aiadra-solver/dist/*.pyd
aiadra-solver/src/boost/
aiadra-solver/testkit/output/
aiadra-solver/testkit-output/
